  "prefLabel": "Env-A 305.01 Primary Ambient Air Quality Standards for Carbon Monoxide (CO)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 305.01 Primary Ambient Air Quality Standards for Carbon Monoxide (CO). The primary ambient air quality standards for carbon monoxide (CO), CAS # 630-08-0, shall be as follows:\n\n(a) The 8-hour primary ambient air quality standard for CO shall be 9 ppm, 8-hour average concentration; and\n\n(b) The 1-hour primary ambient air quality standard for CO shall be 35 ppm, 1-hour average concentration.\n\nSource. #6227, eff 4-25-96; ss by #8054, eff 2-28-04; ss by #10173, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13382, eff 5-25-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a300.html"
